{{!-- The one row this Scar is: the number that chose it, its title, and its prose. The number is
      the HP the hit took — printed, not typed — or, opened from the Scars tab where there was no
      hit, the row picked below. Where the row names a place, the place joins the title once its
      die has landed: it is part of the Scar's name, not one of its effects.

      The Warden may say another row applies, so the table opens from here for them; a player
      answering a hit gets no toggle, because the row is not theirs to change. --}}
<header class="cairn-scars-head">
    <p class="cairn-scars-lost">
        <span class="cairn-scars-lost-n">{{number}}</span>
        <span class="cairn-scars-lost-label">{{#if hpLost}}{{localize 'CAIRN.Scar.HpLost'}}{{else}}{{localize 'CAIRN.Scar.Entry'}}{{/if}}</span>
    </p>
    <div class="cairn-scars-row-text">
        <h2 class="cairn-scars-name">{{name}}</h2>
        {{#if placeDice}}
        <p class="cairn-scars-dice">{{placeDice}}</p>
        {{/if}}
        <p class="cairn-scars-prose">{{text}}</p>
        {{#if canToggle}}
        <button type="button" class="cairn-scars-toggle" data-action="scarToggleTable">
            {{#if tableOpen}}{{localize 'CAIRN.Scar.HideTable'}}{{else}}{{localize 'CAIRN.Scar.ShowTable'}}{{/if}}
        </button>
        {{/if}}
    </div>
</header>
